==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Red Slug]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Red Malice]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Slug]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this stage entirely consists of Red enemies, many of your usual counters to Red (e.g. Courier, Roe, iCat) and any anti-Red ubers you may happen to have will help. Whilst it is worth noting that The Red Malice does outrange most of the common anti-Red Cats, if you can get iCat to perma-freeze him, it won't be an issue.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], B.B.Bunny was set to spawn every 6.67~1.33 seconds instead of just 6.67. It didn't work properly because the maximum time was lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

